Chromospherically active stars:
Lithium and CNO abundances in northern RS CVn stars.
    Bale B., Tautvaisiene G., Minkeviciute R., Drazdauskas A., Mikolaitis S.,
    Stonkute E., Ambrosch M.
    <Astron. Astrophys. 703, A128 (2025)>
